<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Castles in the Sand Z4/Z3 x 4</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

Castle Sets of 1minutes at Z4 to start the set, h followed by 5minutes of Z3, then finish the set with 1minutes of Z4.
4 sets today with five minutes of Z1/2 as rest between each

RPE guide: 104% FTP -> RPE 6-7; 85% FTP -> RPE 5-6; 75% FTP -> RPE 3; 55% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="300" PowerLow="0.40" PowerHigh="0.50"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.75"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="60" Power="1.04"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.85"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="60" Power="1.04"/>
